@baseUrl = https://localhost:7219

### Listado paginado de guias publicadas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide?page=1&pageSize=12
Accept: application/json

### Listado filtrado por categoria y texto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide?page=1&pageSize=12&category=leveling&search=nivel
Accept: application/json

### Pagina fuera de rango (devuelve lista vacia, no 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide?page=99&pageSize=12
Accept: application/json

### Categorias de guias
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide/categories
Accept: application/json

### Detalle por slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide/subir-nivel-1-80-rapido
Accept: application/json

### Detalle inexistente (404 con ProblemDetails)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide/no-existe
Accept: application/json

# ============ ADMIN ============
# Pega aqui el token JWT de un usuario con el claim Admin.
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_ADMIN

### Listado admin (incluye borradores)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide/manage?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Detalle admin por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide/manage/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Eliminar guia
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Crear y editar son multipart/form-data (portada + campos).
# Usa Swagger UI (POST /api/Guide y PUT /api/Guide/{id}) para probarlos con archivo.

### Registrar vista (publico, best effort)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide/subir-nivel-1-80-rapido/view

### Crear categoria de guias
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PvP",
  "description": "Guias de jugador contra jugador",
  "sortOrder": 4
}

### Editar categoria de guias
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PvP",
  "description": "Guias de jugador contra jugador",
  "sortOrder": 4
}

### Eliminar categoria de guias (las guias quedan sin categoria)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Guide/categories/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
